    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34707" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνᾰγ-ίζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					6.51
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				7.30
			</span></i>:—<i>offer sacrifice to the dead</i>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύω</span> (to the gods), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.167
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὶ ὡς ἥρωϊ</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύειν τινὶ ὡς ἀθανάτῳ</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.44
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				6.51
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				23.10.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς κατὰ πόλεμον τελευτήσασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1006.26
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>: c. acc. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀποπυρίδας τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Clearch.
					16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κριόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Thes.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
